SiLU / Swish	z · σ(z)	≈ (−0.28, ∞)	Modern CNNs, LLaMA-style FFNs (SwiGLU)	—
Softmax	e^zᵢ / Σⱼ e^zⱼ	(0, 1), sums to 1	Multi-class output layer	Overflows without the max-subtraction trick
