  ('23ec3c60-77d1-7c44-9408-886423c4300a', 'a0', 'text', '{"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Transformer (“Attention Is All You Need”, 2017) drops recurrence entirely: stacks of self-attention and feed-forward layers, with residual connections and layer norm. It powers modern language, vision and audio models."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tokens → Embeddings + positional encoding → N × [Multi-head attention → Add & Norm → Feed-forward → Add & Norm] → Output head"}]}]}}'),
