ional build without the GIL ("},{"type":"text","text":"python3.13t","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"); in 3.14 it is officially supported (PEP 779) as "},{"type":"text","text":"python3.14t","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Pure-Python threads then run truly in parallel, at a small single-thread cost."}]}]}]}]}}'),
